// ─────── Edge routing ───────
// Pick the connection side on each rect based on the direction toward the
// other rect's centre, then build cubic-bezier control points along the chosen
// sides' outward normals. The curve enters/leaves perpendicular to each edge,
// which is what makes the arrow head land cleanly even when nodes aren't
// orthogonally aligned. Returns the 4 path points + the chosen sides.
//   A, B: { x, y, w, h }
//   opts.tensionMin / tensionMax: control-point distance bounds (default 40, 180)
